Z||000011||SLAMMED87GT||12-03-2001||10:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Heretic:<BR><B> Just wondering , but would that get in the way to the shifter somehow if there is cups in there?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nope, the holder is made just right so that it does not get in your way when shifting. There are two different models, one for autos and one for manuals. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pfierosig2_1.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR>3" Drop, 17" Primax 618s/Nitto540 205/40, 4" Monza exhaust, Mudstain decklid scoop, 7" wing stands, Clear front and rear lights, custom interior, all options...that's all hehe.||||reg||1
