Z||000014||Max The Chainsaw||12-04-2001||08:44 PM||||Here's mine. I made it myself out of oak and dowel rod. <P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero020.jpg">  <P>I drilled a hole thru the bottom and ran a light in the middle between the support dowels hooked to my guage lights. A red colored bulb is there to match the guage color. Looks nice at night.<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>[This message has been edited by Max The Chainsaw (edited 12-04-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Max The Chainsaw (edited 12-04-2001).]||||reg||1
